The EV68 is in fact much faster than the PCA56, since it has out of
order execution and more functional units. Given the crappy cache
system of the SX164 and the typically very good one of the EV6 class
machines, the difference is typically maybe factor 2 given equal MHz
(example: MPEG4 playback is 3.5 times faster on an UP1500 800MHz than
on an 533MHz SX164).

-- 
